{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/raiha-villas-bt-properties-dubai-south","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":1376,"crm_id":"196","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":null,"title":"Raiha Villas","slug":"raiha-villas-bt-properties-dubai-south","display_address":"Dubai South","building_type":["villa"],"completion_year":"2029","developer":"BT Properties","price":4270000,"display_price":"4.27M","lattitude":25.0474505,"longitude":55.2074301,"min_bedrooms":4,"max_bedrooms":6,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Raiha Villas by BT Holdings form a premium residential enclave within Waada, a master-planned community in <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/area-guides/dubai-south/\">Dubai South</a>. The development features a curated selection of <strong>4-bedroom semi-detached villas and 6-bedroom independent villas</strong>. Each villa is positioned within landscaped streets that reflect a nature-led architectural vision inspired by open meadows.</p><p>Raiha's master plan benefits from its placement within a fully integrated urban setting that includes retail zones, a school, healthcare facilities, cultural landmarks, and expansive green spaces. Raiha Villas at Waada are planned with clear zoning, wide internal roads, and access to community amenities, making the project suitable for both end users and investors seeking low-density residential assets in an emerging growth corridor.</p>","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Feature_601883cf0f.jpg","hash":"Feature_601883cf0f","name":"Feature.jpg"},"banner_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Banner_20d5c230ba.jpg","hash":"Banner_20d5c230ba","name":"Banner.jpg"},"media_images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Gallery_6_6a8cfb2d5