 fully planned urban development integrating residential, retail, education, healthcare, and cultural infrastructure.</li><li>Proximity to Key Infrastructure - Raiha's location places it in close proximity to Al Maktoum International Airport and Expo City Dubai, supporting long-term growth prospects for Dubai South.</li><li>Post-Handover Payment Plan - A post-handover instalment plan reduces upfront capital pressure and improves investment cash-flow planning.</li></ul>","design_title":null},"location_tile":{"id":1986,"cta":{"id":2803,"icon":null,"menu":null,"cta_label":"Get more information","isExternal":false,"custom_link":"#payment-plans"},"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/map_894ffc539c.jpg","hash":"map_894ffc539c","name":"map.jpg"},"style":null,"title":"Part of Waada, a Large-Scale Development in Dubai South","heading":"Location","bg_color":"blue","add_place":[],"image_fit":null,"img_align":"left","video_url":null,"icon_stats":[],"description":"<p>&nbsp;Raiha's location places the project within Waada, a large-scale master development in Dubai South designed around integrated residential, commercial, and community infrastructure. Dubai South continues to evolve as a long-term residential and economic district, supported by proximity to Al Maktoum International Airport and Expo City Dubai.</p><ul><li>10 minutes to Al Maktoum International Airport</li><li>12 minutes to Expo City</li><li>24 minutes to City Centre Me’aisem</li><li>30 minutes to Global Village</li><li>30 minutes to Palm Jumeirah</li></ul>","design_title":null},"brochure":{"id":4761,"url":"","file":null,"item":[],"image":null},"video_module":{"id":3412,"thumbnail":null,"video_url":null},"floor_plans":[{"id":4524,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/bedroom_8ab7522b9e.jpg","hash":"bedroom_8ab7522b9e","name":"bedroom.jpg"},"title":"4 Bedroom Villa","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null